          '[s3_star.sampler] rate_per_24h=24 → λ_per_sec=2.78e-4 → mean
          interval=3600s')",
      stale_note: "config _sample_rate_note claimed 'fix_1 (Qwen
          2026-05-29)… 24 → Poisson mean interval 1h… Was conflated →
          daemon dormant 100-day.' — the 0.01 legacy value, NOT 24, was
          the dormant one; the note conflated the two fields.",
      derived_correct_rate: {
        shadow_recompute_intent: "shadow_recompute.rs: 'Expected sample
